diff --git a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
index 6bddff1..c876fcd 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -96,3 +96,31 @@ __Request:__
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Registers or refreshes the browser push subscription for the current user. The user must match the signed-in user.
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://push.example/subscription-id",
+    "p256dh_key": "browser-public-key",
+    "auth_key": "browser-auth-secret"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the subscription ID.
+
+## `DELETE /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Removes the current user's browser push subscription. Provide the `endpoint` inside the `push_subscription` object.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
